WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:09.120
CZ: Hello CZsWorld! I'd like to start by thanking everyone who sent me a message asking for my thoughts

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.980
on the Marina Joyce horror that's been going on over the last month.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:16.000
I went ahead and watched her videos and I would definitely agree there are some creepy undertones there.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.980
If you don't know, Marina Joyce is a British vlogger who became the center of a hashtag, #savemarinajoyce,

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.120
when she began to act strangely in her videos and people began to notice things like bruises,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.920
people controlling her and apparent cries for help and encoded messages on her channel.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:34.580
So I decided, why not get Marina herself on the line to discuss some of the weird stuff that I've noticed in her videos?

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.060
How you doing today Marina?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.240
Marina: Hello!I just want to let you all know that I'm just fine,

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.920
and that I'm fine, and right now I'm in a really positive state of mind.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:51.160
CZ: That's wonderful to hear Marina. It sounds like we may be having a little bit of connection issues here,

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.320
but I know there are a lot of people out there who are genuinely worried about you right now.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.660
and I'm not personally of the belief that you are part of like a hostage situation or anything, but

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.280
I do see some questionable things going on in your videos. Now can--

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:08.480
Marina: I think that, sorry, I think that there are a lot of people out there who think that I have changed,

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:11.740
and they are leaving comments and saying that I have changed,

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:16.580
but I do want everyone to know that I have not changed and that I love you guys so much,

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:23.620
and that's not something I would ever do to my viewers is to change myself or to change my videos.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.260
CZ: Alright, well, I'll tell you what.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:29.000
I've got a big list of strange things that I took note of while watching your channel.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.180
Can we just kind of go through and get your side of the story on some of these big ones

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.340
so you can finally put some of these questions behind you?

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:37.080
Marina: I would love to do that. Ask me anything!

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.800
CZ: So it seems like all the controversy began on your video, HOW TO LOSE WEIGHT.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:46.820
A lot of people have been theorizing that your "captors" told you to make this video as a reaction

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:50.580
to the comments that you're getting thinner. So, what's your official statement on that?

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:55.140
Marina: So the reason that people actually have been leaving those comments is that actually,

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.180
I have lost weight after I became vegan.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:02.200
And if anyone is thinking of becoming a vegan I would definitely recommend it,

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:06.620
and after I became vegan I became filled with all of this positive energy.

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:10.420
And now whenever I drink milk, I don't drink milk anymore--

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:12.560
CZ: Whoa, whoa. Hold up for one sec.

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:17.220
So, when you say "positive energy", you just mean you feel healthy?

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:20.800
Or... are you talking about some kind of spiritual energy?

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:29.740
Marina: I'm sorry, can you hold on for just one second? I just have to go do something for just one second.

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.020
CZ: Sure, take all the time you need.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.980
*garbled background speech*

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.920
CZ: Marina? Huh.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:52.860
*garbled background speech*

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.640
*loud crash*

00:02:54.760 --> 00:03:00.580
*garbled background speech*

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.120
CZ:What the...

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:16.640
*background cries*

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.320
Marina: OK, sorry about that.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.700
CZ: Uhh, no worries. Is everything OK?

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.920
Marina: Yeah. I just had to turn off the telly in the other room.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.340
CZ: Hey... Marina... Uhm....

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:44.540
Um, like I said earlier, I think some of the rumors flying around about you right now are pretty crazy.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:51.520
But if there is, I don't know, SOMETHING, going on right now,

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:56.960
Well, you should just know that it's not too late to come forward and be direct about it.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.960
Marina: It's nothing like that. I am fine. I swear. I'm fine.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.160
CZ: OK. I'll take your word for it.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.320
But just keep that in mind.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.560
So I think we left off on the lose weight video.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:17.120
It looks like you have some heavy bruising on your knuckles. Is there an explanation for that?

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:21.200
Marina: Yeah, I was going to the cupboard to retrieve a snack.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.040
And I, what I did was by accident,

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.960
by accident I smashed my hand inside the door.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:29.240
CZ: Alright. I guess that makes sense.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.680
But what about the THINGS THAT GIRLS DO THAT GUYS HATE video?

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:38.080
Your knees are covered in bruises, and then in one of the skits we see your boyfriend grab your arm

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.640
in a spot where bruises appear in a later video.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:45.080
Marina: Oh my gosh, no, no! I never even picked up on that.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:50.520
No, I got those because, what had happened was, I was having a walk in the forest,

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:55.160
and I accidentally had a fall, in the forest, and that's how I got the bruises.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:05:01.520
CZ: OK. I heard you mention something like that in the interview that you did with Philip DeFranco I believe.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:05.240
But, I mean, I assume we're just talking about one fall that you had, and

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.600
some of these bruises do look pretty bad.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:13.360
Marina: Like I mentioned before, it was after I went vegan, and so after I went vegan, I became

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:21.400
I began to feel much better positive energy, but one of the drawbacks is it is much more difficult to obtain vitamins,

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.720
so it was very easy for me to bruise.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:29.440
CZ: Maybe this is just the meat-eater in me talking, but I thought you said you were much healthier as a vegan,

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:33.280
and actually I wrote down this quote, from one of your videos, that I found kind of odd.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:45.240
But if you're getting bruises so easily from being a vegan, that just seems to be like a contradiction.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.200
So, what's the point of continuing?

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:52.320
Marina: It really isn't the fact that I am vegan, because

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.400
what I want to do with my life is to save the animals,

00:05:55.400 --> 00:06:00.480
because I love animals and I believe that all animals should be allowed to exist in our world.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:05.880
But when I first became a vegan I didn't know how to get the proper nutrients,

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:10.400
So that, what would happen is I would get these bruises from very mundane tasks.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:15.080
CZ: Alright, alright, fair enough. Let's jump to your next video: CURLING WITH A STRAIGHTENER.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:18.960
There's a time-lapse sequence with music over it where I can see you talking where I can see you talking to someone.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:19.800
Who is that?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:27.920
Marina: I'm not really sure I remember, but it could be my mum, because my mum is amazing and I love her,

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.240
and she's very supportive of myself,

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.800
and what she will do, my mum will help me film my videos.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.800
CZ: Obviously you have a very close relationship with your mother,

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:39.720
and I think that what has people concerned with this video,

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:42.360
and I'm not trying to be accusatory here,

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:46.160
is that you look very uncomfortable whenever you are looking or talking off camera.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:49.240
And then the other thing is that there's no camera movement anywhere in the video,

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51.160
so why would you even need help making it.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.840
*garbled speech*

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.400
CZ: Marina, you're cutting out.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.240
*garbled speech*

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.280
CZ: Can you hear me?

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.000
*garbled speech*

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:01.680
CZ: Marina?

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:05.200
*garbled speech*

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.520
CZ: Marina? Can you hear me now?

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.240
Marina: Oh, yes, I can hear you.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.600
I do apologize because my internet can tend to be a bit rubbish at times.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.520
CZ: No worries, just a couple more questions on that video.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.520
In the background, and this is something that I've seen in a lot of your recent videos,

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:25.760
you can see these dinner plates, which has given people the ideas that you're locked up in a room, and

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.080
you're being given these meals everyday or something.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:32.880
Again, I don't subscribe to the kidnapper theory, I think it's total crap, but what can you tell us about that?

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.720
Marina: Oh no, it's nothing like that.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.840
I'm just very lazy about remembering to put my dish away.

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:42.320
CZ: At the end of the video you say I wish to speak with you in the comments,

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:45.480
but then you don't reply to any of the comments. What is that about?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:50.400
Marina: I just get so many messages and I don't always get time to reply, but

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:54.880
I still love my viewers so much and I love them, they are so important to me!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:08:00.920
CZ: But what I'm asking is, why would you specifically say, "I wish to speak with you",

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:04.400
if you know for a fact that you won't have time to reply to the comments?

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.800
Is this a cry for help of sorts?

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:09.280
Marina: No! I'm fine. I swear, I'm fine.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:16.120
CZ: OK. Like I said, I believe you, but how do you explain what you said in DYING MY HAIR PINK, where you ask

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.680
the viewers for tips on healing yourself and tell everyone that you're really good at dealing with pain?

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:25.600
Marina: When I said, that, what I was referring to when I said that--

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:26.640
*glass shatters*

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.960
CZ: Marina? Everything OK?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:33.840
Marina: Yes... Yes. Everything is fine. I am so happy!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:39.240
CZ: Alright, um, well I know you're short on time so what do you say we skip to the big one?

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:40.640
DATE OUTFIT IDEAS?

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.920
Marina: I felt like you might be asking about that one actually.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:47.800
CZ: There's so much questionable stuff going on in this video.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:50.320
People off camera seem to be telling you what to do,

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:51.160
weird behaviour,

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:53.200
someone watching you through the window?

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.360
And then something keeps scaring your cat,

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.160
there's bruises,

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:59.000
and then there's this subliminal frame of you holding your head?

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.680
Where do we even begin with this?

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:02.400
Marina: Oh no...

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:03.680
CZ: What's that?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.200
Marina: Please excuse me for one... one more second.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:09.340
CZ: OK, Marina, what's going on over there?

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.180
*whispers*

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.120
CZ: Marina? Can you hear me?

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.760
Marina: No!

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:17.060
*object falling over*

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:17.560
CZ: My God...

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:19.320
*screaming and begging*

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.920
CZ: Marina? Marina, what's happening?!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.640
*screaming*

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.360
CZ: Marina?

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:45.000
*screaming, crying, chaos, destruction*

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:08.000
*breathing*

